# VATranscribe

> Production-ready media download & AI transcription platform.  
> Download MP4 / MP3, process media asynchronously, transcribe speech to text, export subtitles and documents.

---

## Preview

VATranscribe is a scalable backend-first platform designed for:

- downloading media from supported URLs
- converting video/audio assets
- asynchronous queue processing
- speech-to-text transcription
- subtitle generation
- future desktop + web UI clients

Built with clean architecture and production deployment in mind.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|------|------------|
| Backend API | FastAPI |
| Queue | Celery |
| Broker | Redis |
| Database | PostgreSQL |
| ORM | SQLAlchemy 2 |
| Migrations | Alembic |
| Media Download | yt-dlp |
| Media Processing | FFmpeg |
| AI Speech-to-Text | Faster-Whisper |
| Containers | Docker / Docker Compose |
| Future Frontend | React / Electron / Tauri |

---

## Core Features

### Media Download Engine

Supports:

- MP3 extraction
- MP4 download
- quality modes:
  - Fast mode
  - Compatible mode (AAC audio)

### AI Transcription Engine

Supports:

- MP3 transcription
- MP4 transcription
- automatic audio extraction
- async processing
- model selection
- language selection

### Export Formats

Generated artifacts:

- TXT
- SRT
- VTT
- JSON

### Job Queue System

Async background jobs with statuses:

- queued
- running
- succeeded
- failed
- canceled

### Logging

Each job stores detailed logs for monitoring/debugging.

---

# Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TD

A[Client: Web / Desktop] --> B[FastAPI REST API]

B --> C[(PostgreSQL)]
B --> D[(Redis)]

B --> E[Celery Queue]
E --> F[Worker]

F --> G[yt-dlp]
F --> H[FFmpeg]
F --> I[Faster-Whisper]

F --> C
```
