## API Overview
### Health
GET /api/v1/health/live  
GET /api/v1/health/ready
### Jobs
GET  /api/v1/jobs  
GET  /api/v1/jobs/{id}  
GET  /api/v1/jobs/{id}/logs  
POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/retry  
POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/cancel  
### Downloads
POST /api/v1/downloads/analyze  
POST /api/v1/downloads/jobs  
### Transcriptions
POST /api/v1/transcriptions/jobs  
GET  /api/v1/transcriptions/{id}
## Quick Start
### 1. Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/AlexShcherb1173VATranscribe.git    
cd VATranscribe  
### 2. Environment
#### Create .env
APP_ENV=development

POSTGRES_DB=vatranscribe
POSTGRES_USER=postgres
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=postgres

DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://postgres:postgres@db:5432/vatranscribe

REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379/0

FFMPEG_PATH=/usr/bin/ffmpeg
FFPROBE_PATH=/usr/bin/ffprobe
YT_DLP_PATH=yt-dlp
### Run
docker compose up --build
### Migrate DB
docker compose exec api alembic upgrade head
### Swagger Docs
http://localhost:8000/docs
## Example Workflow
### Download MP3
POST /api/v1/downloads/jobs
{
  "url": "https://youtube.com/...",
  "requested_format": "mp3",
  "requested_file_name": "lesson_01"
}
### Transcribe Media
POST /api/v1/transcriptions/jobs
{
  "media_asset_id": "UUID",
  "model_name": "small",
  "language": "ru"
}
